    "date": 1701326851,
    "caption": "🦾 Join us for an enlightening session where we delve into NVIDIA's transformative journey from a graphics company to a trillion-dollar powerhouse driving AI innovations across various industry verticals. \n\nIn this webinar, you'll have the opportunity to connect with NVIDIA experts and gain valuable insights into:\n\n🔹 Why NVIDIA Leads in the AI Market: understand the factors that position NVIDIA at the forefront of the AI revolution and what distinguishes it from others\n🔹 Generative AI and AI Applications: explore real-world AI applications and the flourishing field of Generative AI\n🔹 Accelerating Your Startup Journey with NVIDIA: discover NVIDIA’s complementary startup program that nurtured OpenAI, HuggingFace, CITIX, Cerebra and other 16,000 tech startups globally, and the extensive support that includes access to cloud credits worth up to $100K, technical enablement, venture capital support, and more\n \nWe look forward to your participation in this exciting webinar!\n\nThe webinar will be held on Zoom. \n❗️Register by the link in the profile description.",
